Package: conceptR
Title: Concept Lifecycle, Evaluation, and Scoring for Ontology-Based Systems
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Versioned, scoped concept definitions evaluated as SQL expressions
    against ontology object types. Concepts are hypotheses: they can be drafted,
    activated, deprecated, and compared. Supports concept templates, inheritance,
    composite scores, and scenario analysis.
Depends: R (>= 3.6)
Imports:
    DBI,
    jsonlite,
    cli
Suggests:
    duckdb,
    RSQLite,
    ontologySpecR,
    objectSetsR,
    auditR,
    objectExploreR,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
